{"title":"2023 IOQM/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IOQM/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sequence\" title=\"Sequence\">sequence</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/0/1f096eb7c625994d8453665ed07bd0378488d985.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{a_n\\}_{n\\geq0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"65\" height=\"20\" /> is defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/4/ea47b324908b7a67b59b71b4cb31334dfb4fe943.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/0/ee0a2bac56188ffba7a761cc60e55e4a0e5a73eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 = -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/9/fe99b992de737458d4df06de34663db63d88ec61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+2} = -4a_{n+1} - 7a_n, \\text{for } n \\geq 0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"253\" height=\"18\" /> Find the number of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive_integer\" title=\"Positive integer\">positive integer</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Divisors\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Divisors\">divisors</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/9/d490645a3373d26675ab6661b9b99bc74472bf62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{50}^2 - a_{49}a_{51}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"95\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IOQM/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/d/71d55167556d99787a3fefab2386ebfbd1810301.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E_n=a_n^2-a_{n-1}a_{n+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"161\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>First, calculate a few terms:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/e/66e4652f8f11f781e84ed0d62f13a8ae41402633.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0=1,\\quad a_1=-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"141\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/3/a5343082d81a135e51aef3b656aa92243a1dd652.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2=-4(-4)-7(1)=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"192\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/a/9cab0236ff22f532e5565380977b1d1e9d3e9222.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_3=-4(9)-7(-4)=-8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"206\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/e/8fe805e871821bee9021a80bbbe367cf4a583f56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_4=-4(-8)-7(9)=-31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"215\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Now,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/8/fe80ff9a64832b0156a6f4e545edf5046fc7444a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E_1=a_1^2-a_0a_2=16-9=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"227\" height=\"21\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/7/8e7b5c0d06a0c5f3aa4a87db7a70b80bca71791a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E_2=a_2^2-a_1a_3=81-32=49$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"246\" height=\"21\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bf18063986f33ef63fdfe6eda7c32fdf3400c7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E_3=a_3^2-a_2a_4=64+279=343$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"264\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Thus,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/c/56c66c059bbf46546073819413252a97d8c0c955.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E_1=7,\\quad E_2=7^2,\\quad E_3=7^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"229\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>We now prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/8/b78abf2801603bbeb5b43dfe24b972b1b855da59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E_{n+1}=7E_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>From the recurrence,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/a/58a1b9668c9199880bd15f8b57f0462106721adc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+2}=-4a_{n+1}-7a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"170\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/a/3fabb7505c461bd8b9edfba2ad0d8ba1d05ad7db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E_{n+1}=a_{n+1}^2-a_na_{n+2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"177\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/1/a6154d85d63033edc7761f5e711965d50bdd0cb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=a_{n+1}^2+4a_na_{n+1}+7a_n^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"192\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/d/e4db12e78b296298e221542a688fd52983a3a7da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=7(a_n^2+4a_na_{n-1}+7a_{n-1}^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"215\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/c/cdc23ddc201554f13bf2f895563efad9ca4af6d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=7(a_n^2-a_{n-1}a_{n+1})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/3/8d35f8e87879f87388e39a68c145539a924a9ec2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=7E_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Hence,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/d/99dd7e2572ff2c1d1c65b40b5085c038383a4dc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E_n=7^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/f/3ff6c7caa43c78db69bc8ec6dc35f3940cb45b31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{50}^2-a_{49}a_{51}=E_{50}=7^{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"194\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>The number of positive divisors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bb4d40d61004309c4668ad8537be61de8e18a92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"17\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/f/2cf23ed66ff07116998d77f098512f018a7be72f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50+1=51$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Hence,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/2/0d295acf5c767958d7fb6b98f637296221dce16b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{51}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nNote: This solution was not made by me (biggest_glitter_hater). It was added by a user (who did not name themselves) on the page containing all problems from the IOQM 2023. I merely shifted the solution here as it was spoiling the problem for those who looked through the page.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017194614\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 96/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4960/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:25560:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017194614 and revision id 290668. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}